{
    "$schema": "https://swc.rs/schema.json",
    "comment": [
        "Kept for the swc CLI and for anything that reads .swcrc directly. It is NOT what the",
        "dev server uses: `@swc-node/register` takes its transform settings from the nearest",
        "`tsconfig.json`, so `experimentalDecorators` / `emitDecoratorMetadata` *there* are the",
        "ones that decide whether Nest can resolve a constructor. This file mirrors them so the",
        "two cannot drift into disagreeing, and VISUALIZER_PLAN §5.1 names it.",
        "The Phase 0 spike established the tsconfig path empirically: with only a .swcrc and no",
        "decorator flags in tsconfig, the loader fails to parse the first `@Injectable()`."
    ],
    "jsc": {
        "target": "es2022",
        "parser": {
            "syntax": "typescript",
            "decorators": true
        },
        "transform": {
            "legacyDecorator": true,
            "decoratorMetadata": true
        },
        "keepClassNames": true
    },
    "module": {
        "type": "es6"
    }
}
